{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:docs/implementation/batch2/examples/role-manifest.json",
    "title": "提炼角色运行清单示例",
    "summary": "描述 extractor 角色所使用的 profile、提示模板、内联 skill、输出合同、工具与会话隔离策略以及上下文和修复预算，是可复现角色包的配置示例。",
    "category": "configuration",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "bundle",
        "title": "角色与产物约束",
        "body": "清单把角色标识为 extractor@1，并引用 traex profile、公共与提炼专用提示模板，以及版本化的 omem-extract 内联 skill；输出必须符合 ProposalBatch.v1。[[c1]] skill 的 artifact_digest 仍写为待构建解析占位符，因此这份文件更像构建输入或示例，不能直接证明已生成可验证的不可变运行包。"
      },
      {
        "key": "isolation_budget",
        "title": "隔离和预算",
        "body": "角色禁止使用工具，且不允许继承用户 skills 或 MCP；每次运行不复用 session，用于降低外部状态、个人配置和历史对话对提炼结果的隐式影响。[[c2]] 预算限制为 8000 个上下文 token、3000 个输出 token和最多两次修复，体现失败应受控重试，而不是无限扩大上下文或反复修正。[[c3]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "角色包组成与输出合同",
        "reason": "支持角色版本、profile、提示模板、skill bundle 和输出 Schema 的说明。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:docs/implementation/batch2/examples/role-manifest.json",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 18
        },
        "quote": "{\n  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"role_id\": \"extractor\",\n  \"role_version\": \"1\",\n  \"profile_ref\": \"traex\",\n  \"prompt_templates\": [\n    \"prompts/common.md\",\n    \"prompts/extractor.md\"\n  ],\n  \"skill_bundles\": [\n    {\n      \"canonical_name\": \"omem-extract\",\n      \"version\": \"1\",\n      \"load_mode\": \"inline\",\n      \"artifact_diges"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "工具与会话隔离策略",
        "reason": "支持无工具、永不复用会话及不继承用户扩展的说明。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:docs/implementation/batch2/examples/role-manifest.json",
          "startLine": 19,
          "endLine": 27
        },
        "quote": "  \"tool_policy\": {\n    \"mode\": \"none\",\n    \"allowed_tools\": []\n  },\n  \"session_policy\": {\n    \"reuse\": \"never\",\n    \"inherit_user_skills\": false,\n    \"inherit_user_mcp\": false\n  },"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "角色运行预算",
        "reason": "支持上下文、输出和修复次数上限的说明。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:docs/implementation/batch2/examples/role-manifest.json",
          "startLine": 28,
          "endLine": 32
        },
        "quote": "  \"budget\": {\n    \"max_context_tokens\": 8000,\n    \"max_output_tokens\": 3000,\n    \"max_repair_attempts\": 2\n  }"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "构建后的 skill artifact_digest 由哪个流程解析、写入并在运行前校验？",
        "why": "示例仍保留 RESOLVE_FROM_BUILT_BUNDLE，占位值若进入实际运行记录，就无法证明角色使用了预期的不可变 skill 产物。",
        "nextStep": "定位角色包构建与加载边界，规定 digest 算法和失败策略，并添加占位符不得进入生产 job_attempt 的验收。",
        "blocking": true,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c1"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
